name: ['A-Falcon Abomination', 'Abandon the Post', 'Adeline, Resplendent Cathar', 'Ambitious Farmhand // Seasoned Cathar', 'Angelfire Ignition', 'Arcane Infusion', 'Ardent Elementalist', "Arlinn, the Pack's Hope // Arlinn, the Moon's Fury", 'Arrogant Outlaw', 'Augur of Autumn', 'Baithook Angler // Hook-Haunt Drifter', 'Baneblade Scoundrel // Baneclaw Marauder', 'Bat Whisperer', 'Beloved Beggar // Generous Soul', 'Bereaved Survivor // Dauntless Avenger', 'Bird Admirer // Wing Shredder', 'Bladebrand', 'Bladestitched Skaab', 'Blessed Defiance', 'Blood Pact', 'Bloodline Culling', 'Bloodthirsty Adversary', 'Bloodtithe Collector', 'Borrowed Time', 'Bounding Wolf', 'Bramble Armor', 'Briarbridge Tracker', 'Brimstone Vandal', 'Brood Weaver', 'Brutal Cathar // Moonrage Brute', 'Burly Breaker // Dire-Strain Demolisher', 'Burn Down the House', 'Burn the Accursed', "Can't Stay Away", 'Candlegrove Witch', 'Candlelit Cavalry', 'Candletrap', 'Cathar Commando', "Cathar's Call", 'Cathartic Pyre', 'Celestus Sanctifier', 'Champion of the Perished', 'Chaplain of Alms // Chapel Shieldgeist', 'Clarion Cathars', 'Clear Shot', 'Component Collector', 'Consider', 'Consuming Blob', 'Contortionist Troupe', 'Corpse Cobble', 'Covert Cutpurse // Covetous Geist', 'Covetous Castaway // Ghostly Castigator', 'Crawl from the Cellar', 'Croaking Counterpart', 'Crossroads Candleguide', 'Curse of Leeches // Leeching Lurker', 'Curse of Shaken Faith', 'Curse of Silence', 'Curse of Surveillance', 'Dawnhart Mentor', 'Dawnhart Rejuvenator', 'Dawnhart Wardens', 'Deathbonnet Sprout // Deathbonnet Hulk', 'Defend the Celestus', 'Defenestrate', 'Delver of Secrets // Insectile Aberration', 'Dennick, Pious Apprentice // Dennick, Pious Apparition', 'Deserted Beach', 'Devious Cover-Up', 'Devoted Grafkeeper // Departed Soulkeeper', 'Dire-Strain Rampage', 'Diregraf Horde', 'Diregraf Rebirth', 'Dissipate', 'Dreadhound', 'Drownyard Amalgam', "Dryad's Revival", 'Duel for Dominance', 'Duelcraft Trainer', 'Duress', 'Eaten Aliv